"[HEADER] Installation Infos",
"kill",
"When you click 'START SETUP' in the 'SETUP' tab, dark_souls_2.apworld will be installed and moved into the 'custom_worlds' folder inside the Archipelago Launcher directory. The DLL corresponding to game's version will then be downloaded into the game's core folder and will then be renamed into 'dinput8.dll'.",
