"[HEADER] apworld / yaml Infos",
"kill",
"DS2 is not a core Archipelago game, it needs a custom world file. When 'dark_souls_2.apworld' is downloaded in the Archipelago Folder (by clicking START SETUP), boot-up the Archipelago Launcher and go to 'Options Creator' to create your .yaml file and then, when you're done, send it to the person who will host the AP Multiworld.",
"kill",
"[HEADER] Connection Infos",
"kill",
"Once everything is set up, a new console window (separated from the actual game) should open when launching the game.\n\nOnce in-game, press ESCAPE, then, F10 and type '/connect archipelago.gg:XXXXX [slotname]'\n\nXXXXX is the room’s port. You can find this number on the website after creating a new room.\n\n'[slotname]' is the name assigned to your yaml file.\n\nFinally, you should see a text saying that you're connected and you can now go back to your game and start a new save!\n\n/!\\ MAKE SURE THAT YOU ARE OFFLINE ON DARK SOULS 2 BEFORE STARTING /!\\",
"kill",
